    ( What to write (
        A blog post on {teacher} and {topic}. An opening paragraph that
        answers the title directly, three to six sections with ## headings
        phrased as the questions people ask, quotations as blockquotes each
        followed by its source line, a closing section, and the Sources.
        Between 900 and 1,600 words.
    ) End what to write ) Many blessings

    [= The reply [=
